stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft: save draft
  [*] --> pending: submit with proof
  draft --> pending: submit
  pending --> approved: faculty approves
  pending --> rejected: faculty rejects (remarks)
  pending --> correction_requested: faculty asks for changes (remarks)
  correction_requested --> resubmitted: student resubmits (new version)
  resubmitted --> approved
  resubmitted --> rejected
  resubmitted --> correction_requested
  approved --> [*]
  rejected --> [*]
